{
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse_num": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "hymnal",
          "text": "When the LORD turned again the captivity of Zion, we were like them that dream."
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [
        [
          {
            "text": "+ turned…: Heb. returned the returning"
          }
        ]
      ],
      "references": [],
      "heading": [
        "A Song of Ascents"
      ]
    },
    {
      "verse_num": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "hymnal",
          "text": "Then was our mouth filled with laughter, and our tongue with singing: then said they among the heathen,"
        },
        {
          "type": "speech",
          "speaker": "Unknown",
          "text": "The LORD hath done great things for them."
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [
        [
          {
            "text": "+ hath…: Heb. hath magnified to do with them"
          }
        ]
      ],
      "references": [],
      "heading": []
    },
    {
      "verse_num": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "hymnal",
          "text": "The LORD hath done great things for us; whereof we are glad."
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [],
      "references": [],
      "heading": []
    },
    {
      "verse_num": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "hymnal",
          "text": "Turn again our captivity, O LORD, as the streams in the south."
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [],
      "references": [],
      "heading": []
    },
    {
      "verse_num": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "hymnal",
          "text": "They that sow in tears shall reap in joy."
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [
        [
          {
            "text": "+ joy: or, singing"
          }
        ]
      ],
      "references": [],
      "heading": []
    },
    {
      "verse_num": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "hymnal",
          "text": "He that goeth forth and weepeth, bearing precious seed, shall doubtless come again with rejoicing, bringing his sheaves with him."
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [
        [
          {
            "text": "+ precious…: or, seed basket"
          }
        ]
      ],
      "references": [],
      "heading": []
    }
  ]
}
